  "releaseNotes": "AstraFlow 1.9.0:\n      - Adds the non-packable AstraFlow.Benchmarks project with BenchmarkDotNet coverage for mediator, mapper, projection, and generated metadata paths.\n      - Adds benchmark smoke mode with allocation capture plus on-demand CI verification.\n      - Documents benchmark methodology, environment capture, and the no-speed-claims-without-repeatable-evidence policy.\n      - Full changelog: https://github.com/seifmoustafa/AstraFlow/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\n      - GitHub releases: https://github.com/seifmoustafa/AstraFlow/releases",
